mp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=800\" alt=\"Minimalist Portfolios\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-[1.5s] group-hover:scale-110\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-8 left-8 bg-white/90 dark:bg-black/90 backdrop-blur-md px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase shadow-sm\">Design</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                    <div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-400 tracking-widest uppercase\">APR 28, 2024</div>\n                    <h3 class=\"font-heading text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold leading-tight uppercase group-hover:text-gray-500 dark:group-hover:text-gray-400 transition-colors\">Minimalist Portfolios in 2024</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-light leading-relaxed line-clamp-2\">Why less is still more, and how to make digital simplicity feel premium through motion and typography.</p>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n        </a>\n\n        <a href=\"blogDetails.html\" class=\"blog-card reveal group cursor-pointer block no-underline text-inherit\">\n            <article>\n                <div class=\"aspect-[3/4] rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden mb-10 relative bg-gray-100 dark:bg-zinc-900 shadow-xl\">\n                    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558655146-d09347e92766?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=800\" alt=\"Mastering TypeScript\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-[1.5s] group-hover:scale-110\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-8 left-8 bg-white/90 dark:bg-black/90 backdrop-blur-md px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase shadow-sm\">Code</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                    <div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-400 tracking-widest uppercase\">MAR 15, 2024</div>\n                    <h3 class=\"font-heading text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold leading-tight uppercase group-hover:text-gray-500 dark:group-hover:text-gray-400 transition-colors\">Mastering TypeScript: Pro Tips</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-light leading-relaxed line-clamp-2\">Deep dive into advanced types and building scalable architectures with vanilla foundations for modern apps.</p>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n        </a>\n    </div>\n</div>\n"
